<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-KC Southern upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-KC Southern upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Gruntal &amp; Co analyst Steve Lewins said he upgraded Kansas City Southern Industries Inc to outperform from outperform-long term.</p>
<p>--Shares in the railroad and mutual funds company were up 1/4 to 56-3/8.</p>
<p>--Lewins said he made the move because &quot;rail and, especially, financial service operations are flexing more muscle.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
